sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P as Partner - CA or Tally partner
    participant E as Employer prospect
    participant PP as Partner portal
    participant S as Sales and billing
    participant L as Commission ledger

    P->>E: introduces us by phone or in person, no link
    P->>PP: registers the named prospect before first contact
    PP->>S: deal registration opens, window starts
    E->>S: signs up direct from the published card
    S->>S: no link attribution present on the tenant
    P->>PP: raises an offline referral claim naming the tenant
    PP->>S: claim queued for approval with the registration record
    S->>S: checks registration window, prior direct touches and any competing claim
    alt registration active and no competing claim
        S->>PP: claim approved, partner ID stamped on the tenant, append only
        S->>L: accrual opens on collected revenue, ex-GST
        L->>P: payout statement reconciles to the ledger
    else competing claim or prior direct touch
        S->>PP: claim declined with the reason and the deciding record
        S->>L: no accrual opens
    end
    E->>S: churns inside the stickiness window
    S->>L: clawback posted against the partner balance
    L->>P: revised statement issued
